s/search/?api=1&query=Fairfield+University","access_notes":"The University directs students to Life@Fairfield for the current roster and participation details.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Late-night options in Fairfield's immediate campus orbit have a comparatively thin direct-source footprint. Several businesses expose live or changeable hours, so every late-night card should instruct readers to confirm same-day availability.","The zero-dollar bucket relies heavily on Fairfield University Art Museum offerings because those sources explicitly establish no-cost admission; many other campus activities do not publish sufficiently clear no-purchase terms.","Street and micro-district evidence is limited to corridors and stops documented by the University shuttle, the public library, and the Town's cultural-district materials; no claim of walkability, safety, or fixed travel time is made."]}
